                        "review": "Bought the game for around three to five dollars. I played the first game years ago, maybe around when I was 11, I am 16 now. The game was really good for the price I bought it for, I felt as if the game also introduced a lot more of the lore, especially about Audrey. Also the abyss in itself, I actually got jump-scared a few times. I would recommend the game if you played and loved the first game, It actually encouraged me to read the novels and find about more of the lore.",
